Detector and box-prompted refiner software

Portions of the crop geometry, prompt construction and inverse resize adapt
Artem Shelamanov's filaments/segmenter.py at ArtDoctor/solar-kaggle-public,
commit ea487495ab55aa375fcc36eeb47adc701e79f60b, under GNU AGPL-3.0.
